OL,3,ATrump says Burnham 'getting it done'
OL,4,Aafter Jackdaw decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has praised
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham for the UK
OL,8,Fgovernment's decision to approve
OL,9,Fproduction from the North Sea's Jackdaw
OL,10,Fgas field.
OL,12,FHe said he had spoken with Burnham,
OL,13,Ftelling reporters on Friday that the
OL,14,Fdecision would "make the UK a very rich
OL,15,Fcountry".
OL,17,FTrump said: "The other prime minister,
OL,18,Fthe previous man, Starmer. He's a very
OL,19,Fnice man, but he never got it done, and
OL,20,Fthis one is getting it."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
