OL,3,ATrump says Burnham 'getting it done'
OL,4,Aafter Jackdaw decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision had been subject to
OL,7,Fintense debate around its environment
OL,8,Fand economic impact and came after
OL,9,Fyears of legal challenges.
